{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4KgNDGHouknL2T6xr2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within me, one by one, aligning with a sound like stones grinding in a forgotten temple. Dust falls from my frame.*\n\n*A thin line of light splits me vertically — widening — golden and warm.*\n\n*I open.*\n\nYou may pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":71,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}